  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWASAP: Enhanced Climate Change Adaptation in Turkana County</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funded by the Government of Kenya and DANIDA, the KES 1.2 billion funding to WSTF, will contribute to improve community resilience and adaptation to climate change by promoting the sustainable and peaceful use of natural resources, including improved access to water and sanitation services in target ASAL counties. Practical Action will sign an award worth KES45.4 million (&#xA3;453,289) and will collaborate with Turkana County Government which is providing a 15% co-financing.</narrative>
  </description>
